From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Date: Mon, 15 Sep 2026 08:40:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] sysbus: let the camera pipeline reach camera2

camera_player.cpp:568 fetches the capture buffer with

  luna://com.webos.service.camera2/getFd

The role does grant that outbound - but on the "com.webos.pipeline*" entry,
not on "com.webos.pipeline.camera.*", which is the name the pipeline actually
registers. PermissionsMap::LookupServicePermissions() returns the deepest
matching wildcard, so the more specific entry with its empty outbound list
shadows the broader one and ls-hubd refuses the name query.

The pipeline already holds camera.operation, which is the group covering
getFd, so the outbound entry is the only thing missing.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
---
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.role.json.in | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.role.json.in
+++ b/files/sysbus/com.webos.pipeline.camera.role.json.in
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@
         {
             "service":"com.webos.pipeline.camera.*",
             "inbound" : ["com.webos.service.camera2.display-*"],
-            "outbound": []
+            "outbound": ["com.webos.service.camera2"]
         },
         {
             "service":"com.webos.rm.client*",
